WEBVTT

00:22.890 --> 00:23.730
<b>Sarah...</b>

00:25.520 --> 00:29.110
<b>I can’t do this without you.
You can’t be dead!</b>

00:46.040 --> 00:50.590
<b><i>Your fate is not yet sealed.</i>
<i>Log into Ingress, now.</i></b>

02:44.410 --> 02:46.790
<b>I knew you just needed a push, Sarah.</b>

02:48.200 --> 02:50.160
<b>Where are we?</b>

02:51.120 --> 02:53.290
<b>We’re in the very heart of the Substrate.</b>

02:54.040 --> 02:56.380
<b>You can think of it
as the ultimate computer.</b>

02:57.260 --> 02:59.670
<b>One waiting for a purpose.</b>

03:00.880 --> 03:04.180
<b>Feel its potential
and tell me it doesn’t excite you.</b>

03:04.890 --> 03:08.770
<b>Imagine what you could build
with this kind of power.</b>

03:09.680 --> 03:13.650
<b>I told you. I won't to be a part
of your reckless plan.</b>

03:15.440 --> 03:16.270
<b>Watch closely.</b>

03:24.820 --> 03:25.660
<b>What did you...</b>

03:26.240 --> 03:28.660
<b>The Portal Network
covers the whole planet.</b>

03:29.290 --> 03:33.120
<b>And soon, Dark XM will spread
through all of it.</b>

03:33.210 --> 03:37.710
<b>And mankind will be born into this exodus.
Screaming. Crying.</b>

03:38.760 --> 03:41.130
<b>You will guide them here.</b>

03:41.220 --> 03:45.050
<b>I know you will soon be ready.
Your empathy is your strength.</b>

03:45.760 --> 03:49.810
<b>But it is also your greatest weakness.
Sometimes, one thing must die,</b>

03:50.520 --> 03:55.310
<b>to fertilize the earth and allow
something greater to grow.</b>

03:56.310 --> 04:00.530
<b>Humanity 2.0 awaits.
Superintelligent. Unified.</b>

04:01.610 --> 04:04.200
<b>Use that empathy of yours
and channel it for me Sarah!</b>

04:06.450 --> 04:09.410
<b>That’s enough! I’m going to undo this!</b>

04:18.750 --> 04:19.590
<b>No!</b>

04:22.220 --> 04:24.130
<b>Now. Let’s get started.</b>

04:34.730 --> 04:36.150
<b>Where’s Sarah.</b>

04:45.610 --> 04:49.160
<b>You let her die?!
She was all that mattered!</b>

04:53.250 --> 04:56.710
<b>Everything was within reach.</b>

04:57.250 --> 05:00.170
<b>You cost me my future,
my power, my respect...</b>

05:00.250 --> 05:01.750
<b>And my Sarah.</b>

05:03.340 --> 05:09.100
<b>Killing you is all I have left.
I promise to savor it.</b>

05:09.760 --> 05:11.930
<b>Stop fighting me. Redirect your anger.</b>

05:13.430 --> 05:17.350
<b>The world around you is filled
with pain and suffering.</b>

05:18.230 --> 05:20.440
<b>Even those you hold dear cannot escape it.</b>

05:24.110 --> 05:24.940
<b>Makoto!</b>

05:26.570 --> 05:28.570
<b>Pain served an evolutionary function.</b>

05:29.700 --> 05:32.580
<b>An animal’s communication
with its environment.</b>

05:34.330 --> 05:39.130
<b>But we aren’t beasts, Sarah.
Can we become something more?</b>

05:40.630 --> 05:44.170
<b>The decision is yours.
What should we do now?</b>

05:46.840 --> 05:48.260
<b>Don’t die yet.</b>

05:48.800 --> 05:51.800
<b>You’re all I have left.
And I’m not done.</b>

06:01.860 --> 06:04.070
<b>You keep telling me I get to choose.</b>

06:11.820 --> 06:12.660
<b>That's good...</b>

06:13.700 --> 06:16.000
<b>...I intend to test that assumption.</b>

06:21.170 --> 06:22.000
<b>Sarah.</b>

06:38.640 --> 06:41.100
<b>She’s not going to save you this time.</b>

06:41.980 --> 06:44.940
<b>Thanks for playing anyway,
you pathetic creature.</b>

06:45.900 --> 06:46.730
<b>Alone and broken.</b>

06:47.990 --> 06:49.150
<b>A fitting end.</b>

06:51.820 --> 06:52.660
<b>You’re wrong.</b>

06:55.160 --> 06:57.160
<b>I am not alone.</b>

06:58.620 --> 07:03.040
<b>Maybe they’re both gone.
But Sarah and Jack still fight.</b>

07:04.250 --> 07:09.260
<b>They’re here. By my side.
We all have our parts to play.</b>

07:39.700 --> 07:42.250
<b>I didn’t want to do this.</b>

07:44.710 --> 07:47.380
<b>Then this is my gift to you.</b>

07:49.380 --> 07:52.010
<b>Learn to love this feeli--</b>

08:09.900 --> 08:10.740
<b>Sarah.</b>

08:11.190 --> 08:12.860
<b>I need you to hear me!</b>

08:22.160 --> 08:23.000
<b>What the...</b>

08:25.630 --> 08:26.460
<b>Sarah?</b>

08:27.750 --> 08:28.590
<b>Fascinating.</b>

08:29.210 --> 08:31.920
<b>Are you trying to unite
the warring Factions?</b>

08:32.420 --> 08:33.260
<b>Brandt!</b>

08:35.010 --> 08:40.520
<b>That’s perfect. Even as you fight me,
you’re proving why it must be you.</b>

08:41.770 --> 08:45.560
<b>But think carefully.
Think about what you’re doing to them.</b>

08:47.270 --> 08:48.480
<b>This is torment!</b>

08:50.190 --> 08:54.450
<b>The Resistance and Enlightened are
Yin and Yang. Forever divided.</b>

08:55.910 --> 09:00.540
<b>Your struggle against the inevitable
merely prolongs their pain.</b>

09:01.700 --> 09:02.540
<b>Sarah!</b>

09:03.370 --> 09:04.210
<b>Come on!</b>

09:05.460 --> 09:07.880
<b>There’s gotta be a way to help.</b>

09:09.630 --> 09:10.880
<b>Push yourself!</b>

09:11.960 --> 09:12.800
<b>Harder!</b>

09:42.240 --> 09:45.160
<b>They’re all fighting back... together!</b>

10:06.180 --> 10:09.810
<b>We all have our parts to play...
Enlightened and Resistance.</b>

10:10.900 --> 10:13.400
<b>She needs both of them.</b>

10:13.480 --> 10:15.480
<b>She needs everyone.</b>

10:16.190 --> 10:17.030
<b>Every Sensitive.</b>

10:25.160 --> 10:27.870
<b>Zion. Listen carefully...</b>

10:30.920 --> 10:32.420
<b>Oh, sure, no problem.</b>

10:33.250 --> 10:35.760
<b>It’s just a worldwide,
Cross-Faction operation.</b>

10:36.260 --> 10:39.760
<b>There’s no other path. This is it.</b>

10:42.260 --> 10:44.260
<b>I’ve always wanted to run my own op.</b>

10:44.720 --> 10:46.470
<b>Time to go big or go home!</b>

10:47.350 --> 10:48.390
<b>REPOST REQUESTED</b>

10:48.480 --> 10:49.980
<b>We’re gonna need a lot of people.</b>

10:50.980 --> 10:54.900
<b>Remember that thing you showed me?
All those Links to a single Portal?</b>

10:54.980 --> 10:55.900
<b>Yeah, a Supernova.</b>

10:57.440 --> 11:00.780
<b>Sarah’s reaching out
to Portals all around the world.</b>

11:01.360 --> 11:04.240
<b>If we can power those Portals,
connect them with Supernovas,</b>

11:04.830 --> 11:09.370
<b>it might give her
the strength she needs.</b>

11:13.000 --> 11:14.130
<b>IS THIS AN INGAME EVENT?</b>

11:14.210 --> 11:16.670
<b>"THE WORLD IS NOT WHAT IT SEEMS"
IT'S NOT A GAME, REMEMBER?</b>

11:16.960 --> 11:20.260
<b><i>It's true. The world is in danger.</i></b>

11:20.930 --> 11:23.180
<b><i>But we will save it.</i>
<i>Play your part, Agents.</i></b>

11:35.730 --> 11:37.610
<b>-OPERATION UNDERWAY
-WHAT ABOUT YOU?</b>

11:39.780 --> 11:41.280
<b>Sarah needs all the help she can get.</b>

11:42.320 --> 11:43.160
<b>Makoto...</b>

11:45.830 --> 11:46.950
<b>Good luck.</b>

11:51.210 --> 11:56.000
<b>The Portals. It’s happening!</b>

12:01.300 --> 12:02.300
<b>I see...</b>

12:03.340 --> 12:06.510
<b>I didn’t want it to come to this,
but you’ve forced my hand.</b>

12:11.180 --> 12:12.560
<b>So be it.</b>

12:12.640 --> 12:14.520
<b>I will make your power my own.</b>

12:15.650 --> 12:17.570
<b>And shape the future myself.</b>

12:35.420 --> 12:37.500
<b>Hey, trash boy. You okay?</b>

12:45.680 --> 12:46.510
<b>Jack?</b>

12:48.050 --> 12:50.140
<b>I had a hunch that you'd screw things up.</b>

12:51.600 --> 12:55.270
<b>Hey, did you get a haircut or something?</b>

12:58.480 --> 13:00.150
<b>Let’s get back to the dump, kid.</b>

13:01.400 --> 13:02.230
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:18.130 --> 13:18.960
<b>This is it for me.</b>

13:21.750 --> 13:24.760
<b>You’ve grown. You don’t need me anymore.</b>

13:31.510 --> 13:32.350
<b>You’re right.</b>

13:37.350 --> 13:38.190
<b>Jack...</b>

13:41.900 --> 13:43.230
<b>I’m glad to have met you.</b>

13:44.820 --> 13:47.070
<b>Yeah. Good run.</b>

13:48.450 --> 13:49.910
<b>Now get to the finish line.</b>

13:50.570 --> 13:53.240
<b>And keep running.
Your journey’s just beginning.</b>

14:19.850 --> 14:20.690
<b>Wasted effort.</b>

14:21.690 --> 14:26.030
<b>My body on Earth gives form
to my presence here.</b>

14:26.110 --> 14:27.570
<b>Two halves working as one.</b>

14:28.070 --> 14:29.780
<b>You can’t destroy just one half.</b>

14:30.780 --> 14:32.830
<b>So give up and accept your place
in my plan.</b>

14:52.550 --> 14:55.470
<b>Hey, boss. It's been a while.</b>

14:57.350 --> 14:59.690
<b>Don’t know what you thought
would happen...</b>

15:00.100 --> 15:03.110
<b>But this journey you sent me on
changed me.</b>

15:05.070 --> 15:06.230
<b>The man I became...</b>

15:08.440 --> 15:10.110
<b>Will soon cease to exist.</b>

15:18.870 --> 15:19.790
<b>I'll miss you.</b>

15:21.290 --> 15:22.330
<b>I'll miss the dream.</b>

15:32.050 --> 15:32.890
<b>What is this?!</b>

15:35.550 --> 15:36.390
<b>Jack! No!</b>

16:11.630 --> 16:12.470
<b>Farewell, my friend.</b>

16:13.380 --> 16:17.260
<b>The vision was perfect.</b>

16:34.110 --> 16:35.910
<b>Dark XM’s still everywhere.</b>

16:36.870 --> 16:37.700
<b>Sarah.</b>

16:41.250 --> 16:42.080
<b>No!</b>

16:43.290 --> 16:46.210
<b>Makoto, You can’t be here.</b>

16:55.510 --> 16:58.100
<b>The Substrate.
It’ll destroy you!</b>

16:58.760 --> 17:02.810
<b>We did it. Every Agent around the world
is playing their part.</b>

17:03.930 --> 17:07.860
<b>The Portals are all connected to you now.
You just have to reach out.</b>

17:15.900 --> 17:16.740
<b>Thank you.</b>

17:20.830 --> 17:23.870
<b>I knew I could count on you,</b>

17:24.580 --> 17:25.410
<b>Makoto.</b>

17:26.500 --> 17:27.330
<b>Sarah!</b>

17:29.790 --> 17:32.710
<b>I felt it when I woke in the hospital.
It was you.</b>

17:33.880 --> 17:39.050
<b>But then, I don’t think...
You can’t help me with this next part.</b>

17:40.470 --> 17:41.350
<b>What?</b>

17:41.720 --> 17:43.850
<b>Wait! Sarah!</b>

18:00.910 --> 18:02.330
<b>Sarah!</b>

18:56.210 --> 18:57.050
<b>Sarah...</b>

19:03.430 --> 19:10.390
<b>SEVERAL MONTHS LATER
TOKYO, JAPAN</b>

19:10.890 --> 19:13.560
<b>Makoto.
You sure fell off the grid hard, buddy.</b>

19:14.690 --> 19:16.860
<b>The Dark XM Portals are gone,
but where are you?</b>

19:24.070 --> 19:24.910
<b><i>Final report.</i></b>

19:25.660 --> 19:30.410
<b><i>If anybody has a lead on the unknown Agent</i>
<i>who masterminded this op,</i></b>

19:30.500 --> 19:31.460
<b><i>drop me a line.</i></b>

19:43.680 --> 19:45.470
<b>Your buddy wants to track you down.</b>

19:46.350 --> 19:48.310
<b>And not just him, ya big hero.</b>

19:50.350 --> 19:52.560
<b>I am definitely not a hero.</b>

19:53.480 --> 19:56.320
<b>It was a group effort
between Agents of both Factions...</b>

19:56.480 --> 19:57.320
<b>And Sarah.</b>

19:58.650 --> 19:59.480
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:02.950 --> 20:05.320
<b>How long are you going
to keep up the search?</b>

20:06.030 --> 20:09.830
<b>This is the journey, it doesn’t stop.</b>

20:10.540 --> 20:12.920
<b>Not until I find them. Sarah and Jack.
They’re out there</b>

20:15.040 --> 20:17.750
<b>If you do find Jack,
he’ll probably try to kill you again.</b>

20:20.460 --> 20:24.300
<b><i>Cross that bridge when I come to it.</i>
<i>And I’m going to come to it.</i></b>

20:27.100 --> 20:28.430
<b>Follow your path...</b>

20:29.220 --> 20:31.600
<b>I know someday it leads back to me.</b>

20:33.690 --> 20:35.350
<b>Fork in the road.</b>

20:36.060 --> 20:39.400
<b>So, where are we headed?
Choice is yours, fellow Nomad.</b>

20:40.280 --> 20:43.070
<b>-Well...
<i>-Choose carefully, Makoto.</i></b>

20:44.110 --> 20:46.780
<b><i>Your instinct has proved more valuable</i>
<i>than my data.</i></b>

20:47.120 --> 20:47.950
<b>ADA?!</b>

20:48.410 --> 20:49.330
<b>I thought we lost you!</b>

20:49.410 --> 20:51.700
<b><i>No. The Resistance and I will continue</i></b>

20:51.790 --> 20:54.670
<b><i>to serve humanity’s best interests.</i></b>

20:54.750 --> 20:58.000
<b>ADA, ever considered going Enlightened?
I got a hell of a sales pitch...</b>

20:58.090 --> 20:59.800
<b>Hey, I’m trying to navigate here!</b>

22:54.120 --> 22:56.120
<b>Subtitle Translation by Rika Takahashi</b>
